# SEC-078: anchor .env patterns at every depth — bare `.env`/`.env.*` only
# match the context root, so deploy/.env (written by provision-steward-node.sh)
# and deploy/enterprise-reference/.env would be tarred into the build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
README.md
REDESIGN-BRIEF.md
!web/
web/**
!web/package.json
packages/dashboard
packages/sdk/src/__tests__
packages/sdk/dist
